</section>
<section id="sect-00007"><title>Overview: Wrap Up</title>
  <para id="para-00012">How did you do? Take a moment to reflect on how many answers you got right and wrong on the previous pages. Did you complete the mini-lesson reviews? If not, completing these reviews can help you get a better understanding of these concepts:</para>
<list id="list-00003">
<item>Simplify expressions with exponents.</item>
<item>Simplify expressions using the Distributive Property.</item>
<item>Find the greatest common factor (GCF) of two or more numbers.</item>
  </list>
<para id="para-00013">If you are still struggling, be sure to reach out to your teacher for additional help. Nobody is good at problems like this on the first try. Keep at it, and it will get easier.</para>
</section>
